<title>POLAND: Swarzedz H1 net swings to PLN 3.1 mln loss.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz H1 net swings to PLN 3.1 mln loss.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swarzedz results for period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 H1 1996    H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			3.18  vs   4.99</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			    3.13  vs   1.52 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				  3.13  vs   0.52 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Swarzedzkie Fabryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				49.39  vs  49.43</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  0.61  vs   0.74</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		    0.0   vs   0.04</p>
<p>    income tax				0.0   vs   1.01</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.20  vs   0.49</p>
<p>    financial costs			 6.52  vs   4.00</p>
<p>    depreciation			    1.88  vs   1.57</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
